In general, Starter and Pro Player jerseys are not faked.

If it is a "concept" jersey, like one of the ones below, it is 100% fake.

<img src="images/blues_concept.jpg" width=300 height=220 alt="Example fantasy/concept jersey (Blues)">    <img src="images/flyers_concept.jpeg" width=300 height=220 alt="Example fantasy/concept jersey (Flyers)">
<img src="images/pens_concept.jpg" width=300 height=220 alt="Example fantasy/concept jersey (Penguins)">    <img src="images/kings_concept.jpg" width=300 height=220 alt="Example fantasy/concept jersey (Kings)">

If you're still not 100% sure, feel free to post a link or pictures in the <a href="https://reddit.com/r/hockeyjerseys/about/sticky">r/hockeyjerseys monthly legit check thread</a> or the <a href="https://discord.com/invite/hockeyjerseys">Hockey Jerseys Discord</a> for a second opinion.
